      "content": "ugh my kitchen sink is being so weird. it's draining super slow and there's this gross smell coming from it like something is stuck deep in there that i just can't see. i feel like there is something lurking in the pipes lol. any idea what i can do to clear it out before i have to pay for a plumber?",
